  <item>
    <title>016 | 26年9月天象报告：金星进入逆行阴影，月底火药味升级：十二上升如何应对？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa01c17a0210c197dcfa0b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa01c17a0210c197dcfa0b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:34:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>进入九月，金星进入天蝎，开启金秋漫长的金星逆行周期。</span></p><p><span>九月中旬，天王星驻留、处女座新月发生。</span></p><p><span>9月底，白羊座满月过后，火星进入狮子，火冥对冲，，国际局势、权力冲突和金融市场的波动也值得留意。</span></p><p><span>节目后半会结合整宫制，简要分析九月天象对十二个上升星座的影响，请优先看自己的上升星座。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:00:43</a> 八月天象回顾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">00:03:22</a> 九月天象总览</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">00:06:24</a> 九月初 - 火土四分+土木三合 ：压力与重建</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">00:07:50</a> 九月上旬 - 金水双庙：良性沟通与协作的窗口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">00:09:23</a> 9月10日：处女座新月</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">00:12:31</a>&nbsp; 9月10日：金星天蝎与逆行阴影区</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">00:14:53</a>&nbsp; 9月中旬：水星与三王星的相位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">00:18:10</a>&nbsp; 9月底：白羊座满月 + 火狮子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">00:21:44</a>  上升白羊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">00:22:04</a> 上升金牛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">00:22:57</a> 上升双子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">00:23:44</a> 上升巨蟹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">00:24:51</a> 上升狮子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">00:25:59</a> 上升处女</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">00:26:36</a> 上升天秤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">00:27:30</a> 上升天蝎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">00:28:26</a> 上升射手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">00:29:58</a> 上升摩羯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">00:31:33</a> 上升水瓶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">00:33:10</a> 上升双鱼</span></p>]]></description>
